15
00:02:11.184 --> 00:02:25.589
<v Daniel>It really is. Back in March 2026, Schwartz published a post called Vibe Physics. He essentially treated the AI, Claude, like a very strong, maybe second-year grad student. Right. He handed it a highly technical physics problem, something called</v>

