19
00:02:56.148 --> 00:03:05.710
<v Daniel>Got it. So he gives this incredibly dense problem to Claude and the AI eventually solved it. But I mean, reading Schwartz's account, it sounded brutal.</v>

20
00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:17.672
