00:04:07.337 --> 00:04:08.458
<v Daniel>Right. They don't fit.</v>

27
00:04:08.738 --> 00:04:17.204
<v Maya>Exactly. The energy from that high-speed engine doesn't transfer efficiently to the heavy, slow-moving wheels of the tractor. It's a mismatch of physical properties.</v>

28
00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:28.764
