29
00:04:29.124 --> 00:04:30.224
<v Maya>Yes, exactly.</v>

30
00:04:30.825 --> 00:04:45.450
<v Daniel>So instead of forcing the AI to act like a human physicist, Schwartz decided to stop fighting the mismatch. He started looking for what he calls clod-shaped problems, problems that naturally fit the AI's weird alien capabilities.</v>

