00:05:25.914 --> 00:05:36.584
<v Daniel>just a convenient recipe for staying safely inside that jagged frontier? Are we just avoiding the hard stuff where AI naturally fails so we can pretend the technology is flawless?</v>

36
00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:46.772
