<v Daniel>Right. You're just doing expensive parlor tricks.</v>

38
00:05:49.092 --> 00:06:04.075
<v Maya>Exactly. But Schwartz's bet is completely different. He argues that the real scientific payoff isn't safely inside the center of any single discipline. The payoff is actually in the empty spaces between human disciplines. He calls this the convex</v>

