<v Maya>hull of human knowledge.</v>

40
00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:20.594
<v Daniel>The convex hull. Okay, I need to visualize this. If human knowledge is this big jagged shape with spikes reaching out in different directions, like a spike for theoretical physics over here and a spike for evolutionary biology over there, is the convex hull</v>

41
00:06:20.814 --> 00:06:24.358
<v Daniel>what you get if you stretch a giant rubber band around the outer tips of all those spikes?</v>

42
00:06:25.033 --> 00:06:39.779
<v Maya>That is the absolute perfect way to picture it. The convex hull is the empty space connecting those isolated peaks. Human experts are incredibly specialized. You might have a researcher who has spent 20 years mastering one specific set of genetic markers using one</v>

