46
00:07:05.972 --> 00:07:06.252
<v Maya>breadth.</v>

47
00:07:06.652 --> 00:07:10.054
<v Daniel>Because it has read the foundational literature of every field.</v>

48
00:07:10.334 --> 00:07:10.714
<v Maya>Exactly.</v>

49
00:07:11.615 --> 00:07:21.437
<v Daniel>So instead of trying to make the AI invent a brand new theory from scratch, you use it to port an existing method from one discipline over to a problem in a completely unrelated discipline.</v>

