51
00:07:23.618 --> 00:07:32.960
<v Daniel>But wait, how do you actually do that in practice? Because we already established that if you just ask Claude to do the math, it hallucinates or it takes 110 drafts to get it right.</v>

52
00:07:33.266 --> 00:07:45.670
